<Layout>
	<h1>Hello Github Pages</h1>
	<p>This page is created with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro JS</a> and deployed to Github Pages.</p>
	<p>If you want to, you can take a look at the <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/deploy/github/" target="_blank">guide I used to set up the deployment</a>.</p>
	
	<h2>Tampermonkey userscript</h2>
	<p>Here is a simple user script that hides the header from <a href="https://www.vg.no">the page VG</a>. You can <a href="https://github.com/espenraugstad/astro-gh-pages/raw/refs/heads/main/scripts/hide-vg-header.user.js">install it directly with this link</a>.</p>
</Layout>
